# FRONTEND: BLADE + HTML + CSS + VANILLA JS (no Vue/Inertia/React)
- Layout: `resources/views/layouts/app.blade.php` (header, global search, primary tabs, content, toasts).
  Pages use `@extends`/`@section`; reusable UI uses Blade components in `resources/views/components/`
  (`<x-data-table>`, `<x-form-field>`, `<x-modal>`, `<x-related-list>`, `<x-stage-path>`, `<x-toast>`).
- Per-module views: `resources/views/{module}/index|create|edit|show.blade.php` + `_form.blade.php` partial.
- Every form: `@csrf`, `@method`, `old()` values, inline `@error` messages, red asterisk on required fields.
- Form actions: Save (primary), Save & New (secondary), Cancel (tertiary). Two columns desktop, one on mobile.
- JavaScript: ES modules in `resources/js/{module}.js`, loaded per page via `@push('scripts')`. Use `fetch()` for
  AJAX (search suggestions, inline task complete, drag-and-drop reschedule) with the CSRF header. No inline `onclick`.
- Charts: **Chart.js** (locked). Funnel = horizontal bar helper, donut, bar via `resources/js/lib/charts.js`
  and `<x-chart>`. Calendar: **FullCalendar** (locked) via `resources/js/lib/calendar.js` and `<x-calendar>`.
  Load page entries with `@vite('resources/js/charts.js')` / `calendar.js` (components do this automatically).
  Data comes from JSON endpoints, never hardcoded.
- Destructive actions need a confirm modal (NFR-USE-004). Success = toast. Empty lists show an empty state.

## Design tokens (SRS section 6) - define once as CSS variables in `resources/css/app.css`
- Primary #032d60, secondary/links #0176d3, page background #f3f3f3, cards #ffffff + subtle shadow, text #181818.
- Status: green success, red error, yellow warning, blue info. Priority: High red, Medium yellow, Low green.
- Font: system sans-serif stack. H1 24px bold, H2 20px semibold, H3 16px semibold, body 14px, small 12px, line-height 1.5.
- Primary nav tabs: Home, Leads, Accounts, Contacts, Opportunities, Cases, Tasks, Calendar, Reports, Dashboards.
- Lists: alternating rows, sortable headers, hover state, checkbox column, pagination + "Showing 1-25 of 150".
- Detail pages: header, two-column sections, related lists, dash for empty fields.

## Accessibility and responsiveness (NFR-USE-002/003)
- Works from 320px; tap targets >= 44x44px; semantic HTML, ARIA labels/landmarks, visible focus,
  contrast >= 4.5:1, modal focus-trap + Esc to close, full keyboard navigation.
- Escape output with `{{ }}`; use `{!! !!}` only for sanitized content (NFR-SEC-004).
